  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1100197.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El pub D&eacute;cada, en la avda. Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este s&aacute;bado un concierto del grupo castellonense Los Sidecares (32 fotos), en el que se ha integrado como bajista el ondense Ricardo Ten Quijada. Versiones de aut&eacute;ntico rockabilly y temas propios compuestos por Fran Vilar han completado la actuaci&oacute;n. El p&uacute;blico, sobretodo el femenino, se lo ha pasado en grande bailando.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100197.jpg\" alt=\"p1100197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100198.jpg\" alt=\"p1100198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100199.jpg\" alt=\"p1100199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100200.jpg\" alt=\"p1100200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100201.jpg\" alt=\"p1100201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100202.jpg\" alt=\"p1100202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100203.jpg\" alt=\"p1100203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lossidecaresdecada200615/p1100207.jpg\" alt=\"p1100207\" style=\"max-width